# SECTION 5 — JWT SECURITY AND 24-HOUR EXPIRATION

This section is mandatory.

## 5.1 Dynamic JWT generation

JWTs must be generated dynamically by the Spring Boot backend after successful authentication.

Every successful login must produce a fresh signed JWT.

Never use:

- Static JWTs
- Demo JWTs
- Placeholder JWTs
- Hardcoded authentication tokens
- Fabricated frontend tokens

